# Canonical-form fixtures (WP-21, R-FIX). Format: fixtures/canonical/INDEX.md section 2.
# Written from docs/spec/format/07-canonical-form.md and the chapters it cites; every value is synthetic.
# Gate-0 row foreign: commits imported without a Klotho-Commit trailer. The items come from the git commit
# (block git-commit): item 1 by parent count, item 3 by [F06 §4.4.4], item 4 git:<email>, item 6 N_imp of the
# whole message, item 7 the marker's schema-version, item 9 the object format and the commit's own oid.

